Output docs/vhs/connect-github-no-input.gif
Require vana

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Padding 20
Set BorderRadius 10
Set LoopOffset 50%
Set Height 770

Type "vana connect github --no-input"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4000ms
